        "heading": "Started in Hazaribagh. Built for everyday India.",
        "text": "<p>NutriDates began with a simple frustration: healthy drinks rarely taste good, and the ones that taste good are mostly sugar. Founder Priyam Gupta set out to build the version that sits in between — a date-powered chocolate shake you'd actually look forward to.</p>",
